WEBVTT

00:00:00.245 --> 00:00:01.975
Where’s the right file?

00:00:02.685 --> 00:00:04.735
And what does this column mean?

00:00:05.415 --> 00:00:06.965
Your data is there.

00:00:06.995 --> 00:00:09.015
But its context is scattered.

00:00:09.845 --> 00:00:11.275
Datannur connects it.

00:00:11.765 --> 00:00:14.870
Files, databases, documentation.

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:15.770
One way in.

00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:17.225
Search.

00:00:17.255 --> 00:00:18.785
Find the right dataset.

00:00:20.715 --> 00:00:21.740
Its source.

00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:22.860
Its owner.

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:24.170
Its documentation.

00:00:27.315 --> 00:00:30.425
A column becomes information you can understand.

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:35.670
Definitions, variables, links: everything

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:36.460
connects.

00:00:37.415 --> 00:00:39.107
Knowledge is shared.

00:00:39.137 --> 00:00:41.840
And it stays, even when teams change.

00:00:43.165 --> 00:00:44.190
Lightweight.

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.390
Open source.

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:46.970
Locally or online.

00:00:47.615 --> 00:00:49.275
You stay in control.

00:00:49.465 --> 00:00:50.703
Less searching.

00:00:50.733 --> 00:00:52.214
More understanding.

00:00:52.615 --> 00:00:53.610
Datannur.

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:54.970
The data catalogue.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.170
Made simple.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.375
Explore the demo.
